  "solution": "Given:\n\n(4a - 3b) = 1, ab = (1)/(2), where a > 0 and b > 0\n\nConcept used:\n\n(A + B)2 - (A - B)2 = 4AB\n\n(A - B)² + 4AB = (A + B)²\n\n(A - B)2 = A² - 2AB + B2\n\nA³ + B³ = (A + B) (A² - AB + B²)\n\nCalculation:\n\n(4a - 3b) = 1\n\n⇒ (4a - 3b)² = 1²\n\n⇒ (4a - 3b)2 + 4 × 4a × 3b = 1 + 4 × 4a × 3b\n\n⇒ (4a + 3b)2 = 1 + 48ab\n\n⇒ (4a + 3b)2 = 1 + 48 × 1/2\n\n⇒ (4a + 3b)2 = 1 + 24\n\n⇒ (4a + 3b)2 = 25\n\n⇒ (4a + 3b) = 5 ....(1)\n\n(4a - 3b) = 1\n\n⇒ (4a - 3b)2 = 12\n\n⇒ (4a)² - 2 × 4a × 3b + (3b)² = 1\n\n⇒ (4a)2 - 24ab + (3b)2 = 1\n\n⇒ (4a)2 - 12ab + (3b)2 = 1 + 12ab\n\n⇒ (4a)2 - 12ab + (3b)2 = 1 + 12 × 1/2\n\n⇒ (4a)2 - 12ab + (3b)2 = 1 + 6\n\n⇒ ((4a)2 - 12ab + (3b)2) = 7 ....(2)\n\nNow,\n\n(64a3 + 27b3)\n\n⇒ (4a)3 + (3b)3\n\n⇒ (4a + 3b) ((4a)2 - 12ab + (3b)2)\n\n⇒ 5 × 7 (From 1 and 2) = 35\n\n**∴ The value of (64a3 + 27b3) is 35.**",
